      "date": "2025-11-22T18:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "VLS Finance Limited (NSEI:VLSFINANCE) announces an Equity Buyback for 2,631,578 shares, representing 7.74% for INR 1,000 million.",
      "body": "VLS Finance Limited (NSEI:VLSFINANCE) announces a share repurchase program. Under the program, the company will repurchase up to 2,631,578 shares, representing 7.74% of its issued share capital, for INR 1,000 million. The shares will be repurchased at a offer price of INR 380 per share. The company has fixed December 12, 2025 as record date for the offer. As of November 22, 2025, the company had 34,010,241 shares issued and outstanding",
